<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1354608659"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1881368120"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Better Apart"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Jai Wolf / Dresage"/><amll:meta key="album" value="The Cure To Loneliness"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:54.987"><div begin="00:11.119" end="03:45.303"><p begin="00:11.119" end="00:14.005" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Guess I thought it was over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为一切都结束了</span></p><p begin="00:14.887" end="00:17.835" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">When all I wanted was to leave this all behind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只想把这一切</span></p><p begin="00:17.835" end="00:20.116" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">I thought I had composure<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为我能镇定自若</span></p><p begin="00:20.116" end="00:22.696" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">It's so hard to let you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放手让你走 真的好难受</span></p><p begin="00:24.239" end="00:26.641" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">And now that I'm older<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我成长了</span></p><p begin="00:26.641" end="00:30.568" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">You'd think that I could tell every time it hurt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也许觉得每一次受伤我都会言表</span></p><p begin="00:30.381" end="00:32.881" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I should have known better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把心里的想法都说出来</span></p><p begin="00:32.881" end="00:35.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Than to chase the afterglow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不该对过去念念不忘</span></p><p begin="00:36.970" end="00:40.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Tell me where we been lost in the storm<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 我们迷失在哪里</span></p><p begin="00:40.560" end="00:43.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">I wish we could swallow our pride<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我真希望我们能放下自尊</span></p><p begin="00:43.590" end="00:45.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">And make the will now to break<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接受我们终将分离的事实</span></p><p begin="00:45.526" end="00:49.638" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Close the door and walk away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">关上门 转身离去</span></p><p begin="00:49.638" end="00:55.259" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">'Cause we're better apart, apart, apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="00:55.960" end="01:01.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">'Cause we're better apart, apart, apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="01:02.594" end="01:05.859" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">But every time you tell me that you've changed your ways<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但每次你都告诉我</span></p><p begin="01:05.859" end="01:09.016" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Don't know if I can sit around and play your games<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说你已经洗心革面</span></p><p begin="01:09.016" end="01:14.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">'Cause we're better apart, apart, apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">陪你玩这场游戏</span></p><p begin="01:15.471" end="01:17.764" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">'Cause we're better apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="01:21.472" end="01:23.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">'Cause we're better apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="01:27.878" end="01:30.084" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">'Cause we're better apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="01:34.477" end="01:36.479" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">'Cause we're better apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="01:41.340" end="01:43.442" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">'Cause I thought it was over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我以为一切都结束了</span></p><p begin="01:43.864" end="01:47.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">When I heard that you'd left with someone else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我听说你有了新欢</span></p><p begin="01:47.450" end="01:49.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">I thought I has closure<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为我已经给过去画上了句号</span></p><p begin="01:49.825" end="01:53.107" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">It's so hard to let you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放手让你走 真的好难受</span></p><p begin="01:54.092" end="01:56.278" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">I wanna move forward<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要放下过去向前看</span></p><p begin="01:57.079" end="02:00.294" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">But when you come around, I lose myself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但当你来到我面前 我又失去了自我</span></p><p begin="02:00.294" end="02:02.395" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I should have known better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我应该理智一点</span></p><p begin="02:02.395" end="02:05.892" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I'm afraid to be alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好害怕寂寞</span></p><p begin="02:06.299" end="02:09.993" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Tell me where we been lost in the storm<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 我们迷失在哪里</span></p><p begin="02:09.993" end="02:13.059" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I wish we could swallow our pride<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我真希望我们能放下自尊</span></p><p begin="02:13.059" end="02:15.018" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">And make the will now to break<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接受我们终将分离的事实</span></p><p begin="02:15.018" end="02:19.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Close the door and walk away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">关上门 转身离去</span></p><p begin="02:19.094" end="02:25.287" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">'Cause we're better apart, apart, apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="02:25.287" end="02:31.912" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">'Cause we're better apart, apart, apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="02:31.912" end="02:35.652" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">But every time you tell me that you've changed your ways<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但每次你都告诉我 说你已经洗心革面</span></p><p begin="02:35.652" end="02:38.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Don't know if I can sit around and play your games<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知道我能否静下心来 陪你玩这场游戏</span></p><p begin="02:38.770" end="02:44.477" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">'Cause we're better apart, apart, apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="02:44.984" end="02:47.642" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">'Cause we're better apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="02:50.646" end="02:53.349" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">'Cause we're better apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们天生不合</span></p><p begin="02:57.065" end="02:59.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">'Cause we're better apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们注定分裂</span></p><p begin="03:03.505" end="03:06.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">'Cause we're better apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="03:10.019" end="03:13.059" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">'Cause we're better apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p><p begin="03:13.995" end="03:15.241" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Cause we're better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为分开会更好</span></p><p begin="03:16.442" end="03:18.342" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Cause we're better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为分开会更好</span></p><p begin="03:19.650" end="03:21.382" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">You know we're better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道 分开会更好</span></p><p begin="03:21.382" end="03:25.518" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">'Cause we're better apart</p><p begin="03:26.163" end="03:27.921" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">'Cause we're better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为分开会更好</span></p><p begin="03:27.921" end="03:32.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">'Cause we're better apart</p><p begin="03:32.735" end="03:34.607" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">You know we're better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道 分开会更好</span></p><p begin="03:34.607" end="03:38.386" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">'Cause we're better apart</p><p begin="03:42.411" end="03:45.303" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">'Cause we're better apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们分开会更好</span></p></div></body></tt>